      "worked_solution": "Let's add $y=\\cos x$ to the plot.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14254493/assets/605bdbefb8a740a9b7b273861015896cd36d916a3051ae6b11e40f37f54bce5f.png)\n\nTo plot the given curve, we follow these steps:\n\n- Start with the graph of $y=\\cos x.$\n\n- Then, shift it by $1.5$ units **up**.\n\nTherefore, the given curve is the graph of $y = \\cos x + 1.5.$",
